    <string name="sp_dc_title">Spotify lyrics cookie (sp_dc)</string>
    <string name="sp_dc_instructions">Unlocks Spotify\'s full Musixmatch catalogue (much better Chinese / indie coverage than the public API).\n\nOn any computer:\n1. Open open.spotify.com and log in\n2. F12 → Application → Cookies → spotify.com\n3. Copy the value of <b>sp_dc</b>\n4. Paste below.\n\nThis cookie is stored only on this device. Lasts ~1 year then needs refresh.</string>
